    "extraction_notes": [
      "Product summary and maximum ratings: V(BR)DSS = 20 V; RDS(ON) max = 90 mOhm at VGS = 4.5 V and 120 mOhm at VGS = 2.5 V; ID max = 2.8 A at Ta = 25 degC and VGS = 4.5 V; maximum continuous body-diode current IS = 1.1 A; IDM = 12 A for a 10 us pulse at 1% duty cycle.",
      "The RDS(ON) table has typical values 61 mOhm at VGS = 4.5 V, ID = 3.6 A and 80 mOhm at VGS = 2.5 V, ID = 3.1 A, with corresponding maximum values 90 mOhm and 120 mOhm; both source meanings are preserved as paired extraction entries.",
      "The body-diode table gives typical VSD = 0.7 V and maximum VSD = 1.2 V at VGS = 0 V and IS = 1.0 A. The strict schema has one body_diode object, so the typical value is structured and the maximum is retained here.",
      "Dynamic characteristics also publish RG typical 2.7 ohm, QG typical 1.4 nC at VGS = 4.5 V and 2.8 nC at VGS = 10 V, QGS typical 0.1 nC, QGD typical 0.5 nC, switching times, tRR typical 5.3 ns, and QRR typical 0.5 nC; these fields have no slots in the strict extraction schema.",
      "Thermal characteristics publish RthetaJA maximum 192 degC/W on FR-4 minimum recommended pad layout and 115 degC/W on a 1 inch x 1 inch FR-4 board with high-coverage 2 oz copper; the MOSFET extraction schema has no thermal field."
    ],
